    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">I heard that this place can help people find memories, is it true?&quot; Every sad person steps into the memory flower shop and can&apos;t help but blurt out this question. If someone can help you find the lost memories of relatives and friends, what do you want to know? The memory flower shop does not exist to find the memory of the dead, but to help the living repair the memory. It adds new memories to those who are immersed in the past, just like readjusting and repairing broken memories</marc:subfield>
